    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper structure for critical fault frame flags. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Critical fault flags from bits 7:0 of critical fault reply frame. Per datasheet:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Bit 7: 1V5 supply (1B=OK, 0B=NOT OK)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit 6: 2V5 supply (1B=OK, 0B=NOT OK)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit 5: ADC Bandgap (1B=OK, 0B=NOT OK)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit 4: CLK_TOO_SLOW (1B=YES, 0B=NO)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit 3: CLK_TOO_FAST (1B=YES, 0B=NO)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit 2: DIG_CLK_TOO_SLOW (1B=YES, 0B=NO)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit 1: DIG_CLK_TOO_FAST (1B=YES, 0B=NO)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Bit 0: WD_REF_CLK (1B=MISSING, 0B=OK) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
